  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "13dc97e4-3b1b-4040-a1b3-6aff3487ba02"],
 ", to every symbol in the Global` context and to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["$Assumptions"]], "paclet:ref/$Assumptions"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "a626a06d-75f5-427b-a3b2-d70e292cfb1f"],
 ". It is called after each unload."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->630,ExpressionUUID->"985cea0b-cc5b-4d7a-81b3-8ccdffaa437c"],

Cell["\<\
Revive[sol] walks sol, applying Resurrect to every value, and then to every \
symbol of the Global` context and to $Assumptions.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->631,ExpressionUUID->"2a89cd9d-1094-43e1-a54a-0c2c3721c06d"],

Cell["\<\
It is called automatically at the end of each unload, so that a solution is \
not corrupted by its own teardown.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->632,ExpressionUUID->"4638c4ef-1ec6-4ee7-b52d-0daf30d0db7f"],

Cell["Revive has the attribute HoldFirst.", "Notes",
 CellID->633,ExpressionUUID->"25074827-7e90-495f-af96-ee7462ba7f4e"]
}, Open  ]],

